        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is TCSTRIKERS5, the biggest buzz of 2025. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an orthodox bullet-hell shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players earn combos by knocking down enemies and shooting lasers at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While earning combos, your score is greatly increased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are hit by a bullet, you can cancel the hit by consuming power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect power to advance the battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >User Guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z : Shot(Decide)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X : CrushCancel(Cancel)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift:Laser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S : Accel(Increase FPS)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC : Pause</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crash Cancel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are hit by a bullet, you can cancel being hit by a bullet by pressing the ■ button before your power reaches 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are hit by a bullet, your power is reduced by the cost x 100. After that, power is reduced by the cost every 0.02 seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Crash Cancel button is pressed, it will not respond for 1 second thereafter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is TCSTRIKERS5, the biggest buzz of 2025. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an orthodox bullet-hell shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players earn combos by knocking down enemies and shooting lasers at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While earning combos, your score is greatly increased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are hit by a bullet, you can cancel the hit by consuming power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect power to advance the battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >User Guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z : Shot(Decide)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X : CrushCancel(Cancel)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift:Laser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S : Accel(Increase FPS)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC : Pause</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crash Cancel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are hit by a bullet, you can cancel being hit by a bullet by pressing the ■ button before your power reaches 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are hit by a bullet, your power is reduced by the cost x 100. After that, power is reduced by the cost every 0.02 seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Crash Cancel button is pressed, it will not respond for 1 second thereafter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "short_description": "This is the biggest news title of 2025. A cute bullet-hell shooter is now available. The game features cool and futuristic visuals and active gameplay.",
